{% filter wordwrap(width=80, break_long_words=False, break_on_hyphens=False) %}
The `{{ namespace }}.{{ collection_name }}` Ansible collection manages the configuration of an existing {{ product | mandatory('Missing required variable: product') }} installation through its API. Each module saves one kind of record in the state you declare. A separate apply module then activates the saved changes and checks that the product runs them.
{% endfilter %}{{ '' }}

The collection does not install or bootstrap the product and does not create
API credentials. It also cannot undo a change that cuts off its own access:
read [Requirements](#requirements) before the first write.
{# end skeleton-variant #}

